GIVEN a IS A BOOLEAN, b IS A BOOLEAN, c IS A BOOLEAN, d IS A BOOLEAN, e IS A BOOLEAN, f IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `o 37 r 2(3) documents exhibited to the supporting affidavit`
`o 37 r 2(3) test documents` MEANS `o 37 r 2(3) documents exhibited to the supporting affidavit` WITH
    `o 37 r 2(3)(a) it exhibits a complete and certified copy of the foreign judgment (including the reasons, if any, for the decision)` IS a
    `o 37 r 2(3)(b) it exhibits the exclusive choice of court agreement, a certified copy of it or any other evidence of its existence` IS b
    `o 37 r 2(3)(c) it exhibits the original or a certified copy of a document showing that the party in default was notified of the document by which the proceedings were instituted or an equivalent document` IS c
    `o 37 r 2(3)(d)(i) it exhibits any other documents necessary to establish that the foreign judgment has effect in the State of origin` IS d
    `o 37 r 2(3)(d)(ii) it exhibits any other documents necessary to establish that the judgment or that part is enforceable in the State of origin` IS e
    `o 37 r 2(3)(d)(iii) it exhibits any other documents necessary to establish any matter mentioned in paragraph (2)(a) and (d) to (i)` IS f

