`o 37 r 3(3) test documents` MEANS `o 37 r 3(3) documents exhibited to the supporting affidavit` WITH
    `o 37 r 3(3)(a) it exhibits a complete and certified copy of the judicial settlement` IS a
    `o 37 r 3(3)(b) it exhibits the exclusive choice of court agreement, a certified copy of it or any other evidence of its existence` IS b
    `o 37 r 3(3)(c) it exhibits a certificate of a court of the State of origin that the judicial settlement, or the part, is enforceable in the same manner and to the same extent as a judgment in the State of origin` IS c
    `o 37 r 3(3)(d)(i) it exhibits any other documents necessary to establish that the judicial settlement, or the part, is enforceable in the State of origin` IS d
    `o 37 r 3(3)(d)(ii) it exhibits any other documents necessary to establish any matter mentioned in paragraph (2)(a) and (d) to (i)` IS e

